  "description": "A romance in the quiet French countryside in the 1980s! \n\nJoy, a burned-out shoe designer, came to enjoy a relaxing break for the first time in her life. However, contrary to her plans, the road leading to the accommodation (at the end of a vast vineyard) is very rough. Joy, who couldn't even get a taxi, is covered in muddy water after an old truck splashes her. After all her tribulations, she finally arrives at her accommodation. But before her, Kimmy, the owner of the truck from earlier, appears...! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
